the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SmonMsTOTV8Q7kNvwFoiyKT&_nc_oc=AdoZ8Lkr5WsrtKm1olWsDAl4stGd2pJu7-nSqzFdQkI9iLCc6kLdKn4GfP1x0MuwALs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WJZneel-IAYY_hGkmsfjMuPiEZN-rGF6DRQd43NOlZg&oe=6A3E9983"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6c02ZtLiTdcQ7kNvwGIMquY&_nc_oc=AdrrwYVWKlXyIph_T8jxn0uCeQBob0czyI6fTuO--wUbdij8OpUu-LUGaaIIcz-_vy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-D3fGcX_8IJx5FPNuWgzbNMPGq3FWOtGL4QzEp6TW3Tg&oe=6A3E91D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2kuriRXrrBwQ7kNvwHDOx2u&_nc_oc=AdorMIRFu1yIcTldxg9lkEiOxC5vkXiq_zrhrlgufWJqHaa4arIU_ocef-6pH13DyEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8vJPB_4YsOElGL4wxlpbcNX_hY7XWQVaI2Hb7Yz31UWg&oe=6A3EA4FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080